# A 10 mm cube of quads, with texture coordinates, normals, a material library, objects, groups
# and smoothing groups (sketch-orca probe fixture, parity/oracle/probe/model.cpp). A face of a
# material the library has carries texture coordinates: OBJ.cpp reads them by index, and a face
# without them would read before the array (parity/HAZARDS.md, orca-model).
mtllib cube.mtl
o cube
v 0 0 0
v 10 0 0
v 10 10 0
v 0 10 0
v 0 0 10
v 10.0 0 10
v 1e1 10 10
v 0 10 10
vt 0 0
vt 1 0
vt 1 1
vt 0 1
vn 0 0 -1
vn 0 0 1
vn 0 -1 0
vn 1 0 0
vn 0 1 0
vn -1 0 0
vp 0.5 0.5
g bottom top
usemtl red
s 1
f 1/1/1 4/4/1 3/3/1 2/2/1
f 5/1/2 6/2/2 7/3/2 8/4/2
s off
g sides
usemtl blue
f 1/1/3 2/2/3 6/3/3 5/4/3
f 3/1 4/2 8/3 7/4
usemtl green
f 2//4 3//4 7//4 6//4
f 4 1 5
f 4 5 8
